title: Political Direction
subtitle: How PPS builds its influence.
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: party_affairs
card-image: img/polish/polish_party_direction.jpg
view-if: {! return !!Q.S && !!Q.polish_party_rules && PolishParty.stanceAvailable(Q, 'direction') !}
on-arrival: {!
// Card party.direction (catalogue 4.1; technical reference 10.5–10.6): 1 T, 0 R, the card then waits 6 months. Z — 0.51: the present line can be
// confirmed for 1 T and the usual wait; returning the card to the hand is free.
PolishParty.stanceView(Q, 'direction');
!}

= Political Direction

The present line: **[+ pl_stance_current +]**. A new declaration costs this month's action; it changes no law in force and gives no reform by itself.

- @parliamentary_socialism
- @class_independence
- @workers_gains
- @democratic_movement
- @easy_discard

@parliamentary_socialism
title: Parliamentary socialism
subtitle: [? if pl_stance_parliamentary_socialism_present = 1 : This is the present line. Confirming it costs this month's action and the card waits as after a change; nothing else changes. ?][? if pl_stance_parliamentary_socialism_present = 0 : A parliamentary campaign gains ×1.10 while a PPS bill is before the chambers. ?]
choose-if: {! return PolishParty.stanceStatus(Q, 'direction', 'parliamentary_socialism').available !}
unavailable-subtitle: [+ pl_stance_parliamentary_socialism_why +]
on-arrival: {!
PolishParty.stanceChoose(Q, 'direction', 'parliamentary_socialism');
!}
go-to: result

